@* A box to check, or a radio button, and its label, which a click or a touch anywhere on it checks: a data with two values is
   entered by a box to check, never by a selector of buttons (visuel/saisie-album.md § Contenu). The input is the caller's
   (a native input, an InputCheckbox bound to a form…), styled by the base theme. *@
<label class="choice">
    @ChildContent
    <span>@Label</span>
</label>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Label { get; set; } = null!;

    /// <summary>The box to check or the radio button.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
